# Do not maintain a second set of environment values here.
# Use one of the protected source-of-truth templates instead:
#
#   config/environments/dev.env.example
#   config/environments/prod.env.example
#
# Copy the selected template to an untracked runtime file, populate its
# approved secrets, and pass it with:
#
#   docker compose --env-file /path/to/runtime.env -f infra/vm/compose.yaml up -d
